# SmartComplaint – Online Complaint Management System

A secure, user-friendly web application for submitting, tracking, and resolving complaints. Users submit complaints online, administrators manage and assign them, and department staff resolve them — all through a modern, responsive interface.

---

## 1. System Architecture

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                        CLIENT LAYER                         │
│         HTML + CSS + Vanilla JS  (Browser)                  │
│   Pages: Login, Dashboard, Submit, Track, Admin Panel       │
└────────────────────────┬────────────────────────────────────┘
                         │ HTTP / AJAX (Fetch API)
┌────────────────────────▼────────────────────────────────────┐
│                      FLASK BACKEND                          │
│                                                             │
│  ┌──────────────┐  ┌──────────────┐  ┌──────────────────┐  │
│  │  Auth Routes │  │ Complaint    │  │  Admin / Staff   │  │
│  │  /register   │  │ Routes       │  │  Routes          │  │
│  │  /login      │  │ /submit      │  │  /admin/...      │  │
│  │  /logout     │  │ /track       │  │  /staff/...      │  │
│  └──────────────┘  │ /history     │  └──────────────────┘  │
│                    └──────────────┘                         │
│  ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐   │
│  │               Core Services                          │   │
│  │  Session Manager │ File Upload │ Notification Engine │   │
│  │  Report Generator │ Analytics  │ Duplicate Detector  │   │
│  └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘   │
└────────────────────────┬────────────────────────────────────┘
                         │ SQLAlchemy ORM
┌────────────────────────▼────────────────────────────────────┐
│                      MySQL DATABASE                         │
│  Tables: users, complaints, departments, assignments,       │
│          status_timeline, notifications, feedback, reports  │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

### Architecture Pattern: **MVC (Model-View-Controller)**

| Layer | Technology | Role |
|---|---|---|
| View | HTML/CSS/JS | UI rendered via Jinja2 templates |
| Controller | Flask Routes | Handle HTTP requests & business logic |
| Model | SQLAlchemy | ORM mapping to MySQL tables |
| Auth | Flask-Session + Bcrypt | Secure session-based authentication |
| File Storage | Local `/uploads` folder | Complaint attachments |

