## 3. Feature List

### User Module
| Feature | Description |
|---|---|
| Registration | Name, email, password, phone, role selection |
| Login / Logout | Session-based secure authentication |
| User Dashboard | Summary cards: submitted, in-progress, resolved |
| Submit Complaint | Title, description, category, priority, file upload |
| Track Complaint | Live status timeline with timestamps |
| Complaint History | Table with filters and search |
| Notifications | In-app alerts for status changes |
| Feedback | Star rating + comment after resolution |

### Admin Module
| Feature | Description |
|---|---|
| Admin Dashboard | KPI cards + charts (Chart.js) |
| View All Complaints | Paginated table with full details |
| Filter & Search | By status, priority, department, date range |
| Assign Complaints | Assign to department/staff member |
| Change Status | With optional rejection reason |
| Manage Users | View, activate, deactivate, change roles |
| Generate Reports | CSV/PDF export of complaint data |
| Analytics | Bar/pie/line charts for trends |

### Staff Module
| Feature | Description |
|---|---|
| View Assigned Complaints | Only complaints assigned to them |
| Update Progress | Add progress notes to timeline |
| Resolution Details | Describe how it was resolved |
| Mark Resolved | Change status to Resolved |

