## 4. Database Schema

### Table: `users`
| Column | Type | Constraints |
|---|---|---|
| id | INT | PK, AUTO_INCREMENT |
| full_name | VARCHAR(100) | NOT NULL |
| email | VARCHAR(150) | UNIQUE, NOT NULL |
| password_hash | VARCHAR(255) | NOT NULL |
| phone | VARCHAR(20) | |
| role | ENUM('user','admin','staff') | DEFAULT 'user' |
| department_id | INT | FK → departments(id), nullable |
| is_active | BOOLEAN | DEFAULT TRUE |
| created_at | DATETIME | DEFAULT NOW() |

### Table: `departments`
| Column | Type | Constraints |
|---|---|---|
| id | INT | PK, AUTO_INCREMENT |
| name | VARCHAR(100) | UNIQUE, NOT NULL |
| description | TEXT | |
| created_at | DATETIME | DEFAULT NOW() |

### Table: `complaints`
| Column | Type | Constraints |
|---|---|---|
| id | INT | PK, AUTO_INCREMENT |
| complaint_id | VARCHAR(20) | UNIQUE (e.g., CMP-2024-00001) |
| user_id | INT | FK → users(id) |
| title | VARCHAR(200) | NOT NULL |
| description | TEXT | NOT NULL |
| category | VARCHAR(100) | |
| priority | ENUM('Low','Medium','High','Critical') | DEFAULT 'Medium' |
| status | ENUM('Submitted','Under Review','Assigned','In Progress','Resolved','Rejected') | DEFAULT 'Submitted' |
| department_id | INT | FK → departments(id), nullable |
| assigned_to | INT | FK → users(id), nullable |
| rejection_reason | TEXT | nullable |
| attachment | VARCHAR(255) | File path, nullable |
| created_at | DATETIME | DEFAULT NOW() |
| updated_at | DATETIME | ON UPDATE NOW() |

### Table: `status_timeline`
| Column | Type | Constraints |
|---|---|---|
| id | INT | PK, AUTO_INCREMENT |
| complaint_id | INT | FK → complaints(id) |
| status | VARCHAR(50) | NOT NULL |
| note | TEXT | |
| changed_by | INT | FK → users(id) |
| changed_at | DATETIME | DEFAULT NOW() |

### Table: `notifications`
| Column | Type | Constraints |
|---|---|---|
| id | INT | PK, AUTO_INCREMENT |
| user_id | INT | FK → users(id) |
| complaint_id | INT | FK → complaints(id) |
| message | TEXT | NOT NULL |
| is_read | BOOLEAN | DEFAULT FALSE |
| created_at | DATETIME | DEFAULT NOW() |

### Table: `feedback`
| Column | Type | Constraints |
|---|---|---|
| id | INT | PK, AUTO_INCREMENT |
| complaint_id | INT | FK → complaints(id), UNIQUE |
| user_id | INT | FK → users(id) |
| rating | TINYINT | 1–5 |
| comment | TEXT | |
| submitted_at | DATETIME | DEFAULT NOW() |

